Third-party material
--------------------
The chorale encodings in data/chorales.krn are "A digital edition of 370 J.S. Bach
Chorales", Copyright (C) 2009 Craig Stuart Sapp (https://github.com/craigsapp/bach-370-chorales),
licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International
(CC BY-NC-SA 4.0). See data/LICENSE-data.txt. They are redistributed here unmodified,
except that the 370 files have been concatenated into one file.

Music notation is rendered by Verovio (https://www.verovio.org, LGPL-3.0-or-later),
loaded from the jsDelivr CDN at runtime.
